<p><bold>Phenotypic Implication</bold></p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="width: 135.625px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Type I (inv dup)</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 208.375px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Inverse duplication(22)(q11.1)</p>
</td>
